[863.46, "\u001b[H\r\u001b[2C\u001b[4BThe hyb\u001b[11Gid path passes all checks, with long-context at\u001b[59Gention down to\u001b[74Gabout 394 ms and short-cont\u001b[102Gxt unchanged at 43\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bms. Since cmp.py s\u001b[22Gill us\u001b[29Gd\u001b[31Gthe old CHUNK=1 binary, I'm\u001b[59Grebuilding from\u001b[75Gcurrent source and rerunning the compa\u001b[114Gison\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bblock-diagonal\u001b[18Gpath included.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B \u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;102;102;102mRan \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command \u001b[24G\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m\u23fa\u001b[3G\u001b[39mAll three builds match within\u001b[33G3.7e-5\u001b[40Gover\u001b[45G600\u001b[49Gpositions,\u001b[60Gcovering\u001b[69Gthe\u001b[73Gblock-diagonal\u001b[88Gdecode\u001b[95Gpath\u001b[100Gand\u001b[104Gcausal\u001b[111Grow\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bgroups. I'm re-profiling the fixture-sized prefill next.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;102;102;102mRan \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m\u23fa\u001b[3G\u001b[39mPrefill\u001b[11Gat\u001b[14Gfixture\u001b[22Gsize\u001b[27Gdropped\u001b[35Gfrom\u001b[40G614\u001b[44Gto\u001b[47G455\u001b[51Gms,\u001b[55Gand\u001b[59Gthe\u001b[63G1024-token\u001b[74Gcase\u001b[79Gnow\u001b[83Gruns\u001b[88Ginto\u001b[93Gsoftmax\u001b[101Gexp\u001b[105Gwork\u001b[110Gthe\r\u001b[1B  reference also does, so I'"]
[863.461, "m stopping optimisation there. Next I'll run an alternating head-to-head against v1 and a\u001b[K\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B long-context\u001b[16Gcomparison.\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B \u001b[38;2;102;102;102mRan\u001b[7G\u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell comma\u001b[21Gd\u001b[23G\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m\u23fa\u001b[39m v1 generates 3\u00d764\u001b[21Gin\u001b[24G2415\u001b[29Gms\u001b[32Gagainst\u001b[40Gv2's\u001b[45G1450\u001b[50Gms,\u001b[54Gand\u001b[58Gthe\u001b[62Gtable\u001b[68Gshows\u001b[74Gthe\u001b[78Grest\u001b[83Gof\u001b[86Gthe\u001b[90Gtimings.\u001b[99GThe\u001b[103Glong\u001b[108GGENERATE\u001b[117Grun\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B looks slower than the model\u001b[31Gwork\u001b[36Gexplains,\u001b[46Gso\u001b[49GI\u001b[51Gsuspect\u001b[59Gthe\u001b[63Greference's\u001b[75GO(n\u00b2)\u001b[81GBPE\u001b[85Gmerge\u001b[91Gloop\u001b[96Gon\u001b[99Gthe\u001b[103G900-word\u001b[112Gprompt,\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B and I'm timing ENCODE on its own next.\u001b[K\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;102;102;102m \u001b[39m Time\u001b[8GENCODE\u001b[15Gfor long texts\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;102;102;102m  \u23bf  $ python3 -c \"\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B \u001b[6G\u001b[38;2;102;102;102mimport subprocess,time\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B \u001b[4G  \u001b[38;2;102;102;102mp=subprocess.Popen(['./cb2','model.bin','tokenizer.bin'],stdin=subprocess.PIPE,stdout=subprocess.PI"]
